    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      From our voice bank we pick voice artists matched to the venue's character, target audience and language. The full voice list with audio samples is in our <a href="/en/voice-bank/" class="text-accent hover:underline">voice bank</a>.
