        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2"><strong><a href="/en/voice-artists/konstancja/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Konstancja</a></strong> - warm female voice, experience in educational and museum narrations; works well for art exhibitions, intimate collections, nature trails.</p>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed"><strong><a href="/en/voice-artists/jaroslaw/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Jarosław</a></strong> - male authoritative voice, mature (50+), ideal for historical, documentary narrations, cultural heritage venues, military-themed narrations.</p>
      </div>
